==Trivia==
*Utopia is Over There is most likely a reference to the song "[[wikipedia:Gandhara (song)|Gandhara]]" from [[wikipedia:Godiego|Godiego]]'s ''[[wikipedia:Magic Monkey|Magic Monkey]]'' LP, as it comes right between [[Gandara's Rest]] and [[Godiego Pass]] and one of the song's lyrics is "His very own utopia".

